##### START OF BITBUCKET #####

# Default
Host bitbucket.org
 HostName bitbucket.org
 IdentityFile ~/.ssh/personal/id_rsa

# Work
Host bitbucket.org-work
 HostName bitbucket.org
 IdentityFile ~/.ssh/work/aap/bitbucket/id_rsa

##### END OF BITBUCKET #####

##### START OF GITHUB #####

# Default
Host github.com
 HostName github.com
 IdentityFile ~/.ssh/personal/id_rsa

##### END OF GITHUB #####

